  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.390" end="00:03.990" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-lo-lai, lo-la-lo-la-lo-lai</p>
      <p begin="00:03.990" end="00:07.600" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-lo-lai, lo-la-lo-la-lo-lai</p>
      <p begin="00:07.600" end="00:11.400" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-lo-lai, lo-la-lo-la-lo-lai</p>
      <p begin="00:11.400" end="00:15.060" ttm:agent="v1">La-la-la-lo-lai, lo-la-lo-la-lo-lai</p>
      <p begin="00:15.060" end="00:18.840" ttm:agent="v1">La-li-la-lo-lai, la-la-li-la-lo-lai</p>
      <p begin="00:18.840" end="00:21.800" ttm:agent="v1">La-li-la-lo-lai, la-la-li-la-lo-lai</p>
      <p begin="00:21.800" end="00:25.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yok-eul hado meogeo chehaesseo hado (hado)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.490" end="00:29.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Seoreowodo eojjeogesseo? I do (I do)</p>
      <p begin="00:29.240" end="00:33.400" ttm:agent="v1">Modudeul miwohaneura aesseonne</p>
      <p begin="00:33.400" end="00:37.470" ttm:agent="v1">Nal muneotteurimyeon, bapi doena?</p>
      <p begin="00:37.470" end="00:41.400" ttm:agent="v1">Oerowoseo eotteokhae? Miummajeo samkyeosseo</p>
      <p begin="00:41.400" end="00:44.580" ttm:agent="v1">Hwanal himdo eopseo, yeoyudo eopgo, eum, eum</p>
      <p begin="00:44.580" end="00:48.690" ttm:agent="v1">Mwo geuri anikkowa? Gadeon gil geunyang ga</p>
      <p begin="00:48.690" end="00:52.640" ttm:agent="v1">Waedeul geurae seoreopge?</p>
      <p begin="00:52.640" end="00:57.100" ttm:agent="v1">Maria, Maria, neol wihan mariya</p>
      <p begin="00:57.100" end="01:01.110" ttm:agent="v1">Bitnaneun bamiya, neol goerophijima</p>
      <p begin="01:01.110" end="01:04.600" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, Maria, neol wihan mariya</p>
      <p begin="01:04.600" end="01:09.620" ttm:agent="v1">Mwo hareo adeungbadeunghae? Imi areumdawonde</p>
      <p begin="01:09.620" end="01:13.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah-yeah-yeah) Oh, nah, ah-ah</p>
      <p begin="01:13.320" end="01:17.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah-yeah-yeah) Neol wihan mariya</p>
      <p begin="01:17.010" end="01:20.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah-yeah-yeah) Oh, nah, ah-ah</p>
      <p begin="01:20.730" end="01:24.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah-yeah-yeah) Areumdawo Maria</p>
      <p begin="01:24.550" end="01:28.200" ttm:agent="v1">No frame, no fake, jikkeun jikkeungeoryeo</p>
      <p begin="01:28.200" end="01:31.530" ttm:agent="v1">Haneureun haneulsaek saneun ge da ppeonhae</p>
      <p begin="01:31.530" end="01:33.330" ttm:agent="v1">Naega gal gireun naega bakkugi mwo</p>
      <p begin="01:33.330" end="01:35.250" ttm:agent="v1">Wigineun gihoero da bakkugi mwo</p>
      <p begin="01:35.250" end="01:37.820" ttm:agent="v1">Guji uneun gori bogo sipdamyeon</p>
      <p begin="01:37.820" end="01:39.320" ttm:agent="v1">Yetda, nunmul</p>
      <p begin="01:38.960" end="01:42.810" ttm:agent="v1">Oerowoseo eotteokhae? Miummajeo samkyeosseo</p>
      <p begin="01:42.810" end="01:46.400" ttm:agent="v1">Hwanal himdo eopseo, iyudo eopgo, eum, eum</p>
      <p begin="01:46.400" end="01:47.950" ttm:agent="v1">Maeumeul deoreophijima</p>
      <p begin="01:47.950" end="01:52.190" ttm:agent="v1">Tarakhagien ajik ille, whoo</p>
      <p begin="01:52.190" end="01:56.690" ttm:agent="v1">Maria, Maria, neol wihan mariya</p>
